  "content": "<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/876269993883480154/1206234947329986660/2024-02-11_19.05.37.png?ex=65db44d6&amp;is=65c8cfd6&amp;hm=0e43cac9d5e00bb5b55d40fff93d287fc0af76d9dfce78db439f64c69aa393f0&amp;\" alt=\"\"></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GAPBgY5.png\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Hn7w9amPSu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/758105691633352706?color=3a5197&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=0b2570\" alt=\"\" width=\"222\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;</a><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hgWLz2H.png\" width=\"116\" height=\"33\"></span></span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">🐠 小胖魚🐠</strong></span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;這個模組新增了一種生物——<strong>蘭壽</strong>金魚！牠們有多種不同的花紋，並且可以繁殖。除此之外，還新增了一種裝飾性植物——<strong>水芙蓉</strong>。</span></h6><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kux4WSk.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">📋&nbsp;<strong>特色功能！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">🪣<strong>蘭壽魚與變種</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>蘭壽魚</strong>生成於河流生態域。牠們可以用水桶裝起來，外觀在<strong>顏色花紋</strong>和<strong>尾巴大小</strong>方面會有所不同。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">預設情況下，幾乎所有自然生成的蘭壽魚都是「野生」變種——呈現泥棕色，且沒有花紋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">蘭壽魚可以繁殖，繁殖時有機會產出新的變種。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">總共有 101 種不同的顏色花紋，以及</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3 種尾巴大小（短、中、長）。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這表示牠們共有 303 種不同的皮膚組合。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">🥬<strong>水芙蓉</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>水芙蓉</strong>是一種新的水生植物，生成於莽原生態域的水體中。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">對其使用骨粉可使其擴散。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">可合成為綠色染料。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">用於蘭壽魚的繁殖，詳見下方說明。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>💕繁殖</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在 Babyfat 的最新版本中，蘭壽魚的繁殖方式已改為與其他原版生物相同：只需給兩條蘭壽魚餵食水芙蓉，不久後您就能獲得一條可愛跳動的小蘭壽魚！<br><br>關於 Babyfat 的舊版本：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">蘭壽魚無法透過餵食來繁殖，這一點與其他生物不同。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">相反，必須先用水桶將蘭壽魚裝起來以「馴化」牠們。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">接著，將一對蘭壽魚放入一處水域中，並滿足以下條件：</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">水域中必須在蘭壽魚周圍<strong>十</strong>格內有<strong>一株或多株</strong>水芙蓉。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">附近必須有<strong>少於六條</strong>蘭壽魚。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">時間必須是日出時分。</span></li>\n</ol>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果維持這些條件，蘭壽魚將會自動進入戀愛模式並進行繁殖。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kux4WSk.png\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">🛠️ <strong>相容性</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這個模組也完全支援<span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></span>，內含一本自訂資訊書。我們建議使用 Patchouli 以獲得最佳模組體驗！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kux4WSk.png\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>製作人員名單 &lt;3</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://twitter.com/thecraftyghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheCraftyGhost</a> </span>負責素材繪製</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#036\"><a style=\"color:#036\" href=\"https://twitter.com/fusionstudiomc\" rel=\"nofollow\">FusionStudiosMC</a></span> 負責先前的維護與支援！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tumblr.com%252fpsalidodont\" rel=\"nofollow\">psalidodont</a> 負責模組圖示！<br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
